    "text": "kqennewsradio.com\nwebsite\nRoseburg\nROSEBURG MAN JAILED FOR ALLEGED OVERNIGHT DISTURBANCE\n12 hours ago\nA Roseburg man was jailed for an alleged overnight disturbance early on Tuesday. A Douglas County Sheriff’s Office report said at 4:45 a.m. the 19-year-old allegedly head butted a victim during a disturbance in the 1000 block of Melrose Road, west of Roseburg. The suspect and the victim went to the ground continuing to punch each other.\n5",
